            %h6#example_4 Example
            %p
              The fundamental group of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/point"} point
              is trivial:
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
